      "canonicals": [
        "sound-but-no-picture"
      ],
      "resolution": "Treat a visible Home menu, volume overlay or built-in test only as evidence that the next check should move to the current input, content, app, cable or external device. Never infer the condition of a panel, backlight, power supply or board."
    },
    {
      "id": "silent-current-source-vs-silent-built-in-test",
      "canonicals": [
