      ],
      "resolution": "First select the intended output and run the manufacturer test where supported. Sound in the test routes the user to the source or provider; a silent or unavailable test routes to official model support without naming a failed component."
    },
    {
      "id": "infrared-vs-smart-remote",
      "canonicals": [
        "remote-not-working"
      ],
      "resolution": "Require the exact remote type. Camera observations apply only to infrared remotes; pairing procedures apply only to the matching Bluetooth or radio remote family."
